--// SAIKI EMOTES
--// Clean emote browser inspired by the useful visual/function ideas
--// of VEX EMOTES, rebuilt with a different layout.
--//
--// Layout:
--//   • Emote cards with real Roblox asset thumbnails
--//   • Name + favorite button only on each card
--//   • Emotes / Favorites tabs are horizontal at the bottom
--//   • Search bar
--//   • Lightweight pagination for large emote databases
--//   • Emote Control HUD belongs to the main GUI
--//   • Separate draggable SAIKI hide/show button
--//   • Animated black/red gradient border
--//   • White → red gradient text
--//   • English only
--//============================================================

